            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="about_wave_label">
              <property name="text">
               <string>A slow wave goes from a zero crossing of the filtered EEG (positive to negative) to the next one [1].&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;H&lt;/b&gt;: negative peak (hyperpolarization)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;D&lt;/b&gt;: positive peak (depolarization)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;T&lt;/b&gt;: duration of the wave; 1/T is its frequency&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;τ&lt;/b&gt;: time from H to D; 1/(2τ) is the transition frequency</string>
              </property>
              <property name="textFormat">
